  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "#Milestone Two: Wireframe Your Data Page and Cards\r\n\r\n**Goal**: Design a clear, accessible interface that displays your dataset using .map()\r\n\r\n*Design Spec:*\r\n- A full-page wireframe indicating: header/title, description area, section where cards will render, and placeholders for future controls.\r\n- A detailed card wireframe showing where each schema field will display, with clearly written headings or labels.\r\n- Annotated connections between schema fields and UI labels (arrows or text notes).\r\n\r\n*Constraints and Norms.*\r\n\r\n- Wireframes should be simple (boxes, labels, arrows) rather than fully designed art.\r\n- Every schema field should have a visible place in the UI.\r\n\r\n",
